  "sentences": [
   {
    "n": 1,
    "text": "BACKGROUND AND OBJECTIVES: Proteinuria, a hallmark of renal and systemic disorders, is associated with adv
erse outcomes, especially in chronic kidney disease and cardiovascular disease."
