    "text": "RESULTS: Of the 29 studies included in this systematic review, 25 were eligible for meta-analysis."
   },
   {
    "n": 9,
    "text": "Despite the overall lack of significant results in some aspects of this meta-analysis, the random-effects 
model showed that Vit D levels were significantly lower during pregnancy in mothers of neonates with hyperbilirubinemia
