  "sentences": [
   {
    "n": 1,
    "text": "INTRODUCTION: Theoretically, acupuncture in anticoagulated patients could increase bleeding risk."
   },
   {
    "n": 2,
    "text": "However, precise estimates of bleeding complication rates from acupuncture in anticoagulated patients have
 not been systematically examined."
   },
   {
    "n": 3,
    "text": "OBJECTIVE: To critically evaluate evidence for safety of acupuncture in anticoagulated patients."
   },
   {
    "n": 4,
    "text": "METHODS: We searched PubMed, EMBASE, the Physiotherapy Evidence Database, and Google Scholar."
   },
   {
    "n": 5,
    "text": "RESULTS: Of 39 potentially relevant citations, 11 met inclusion criteria: 2 randomized trials, 4 case seri
