  "sentences": [
   {
    "n": 1,
    "text": "OBJECTIVES: To conduct a systematic review of the literature to answer the question: Has administration of
 recombinant activated factor VII (rFVIIa) or prothombin complex concentrate (PCC) or activated PCC (aPCC) been demonst
rated to be effective in reversing pendasaccharide anticoagulants (PSAs)?"
   },
   {
    "n": 2,
    "text": "BACKGROUND: Fondaparinux and idraparinux are ultra-short, synthetic PSAs."
   },
   {
    "n": 3,
    "text": "Typical anticoagulation reversal with either vitamin K and fresh frozen plasma or protamine sulphate does 
not reverse PSAs."
   },
   {
    "n": 4,
    "text": "Mechanistically, it is plausible that rFVIIa, PCC and aPCC may be effective reversal agents for PSAs."
   },
   {
    "n": 5,
    "text": "However, the available data are limited."
   },
   {
    "n": 6,
    "text": "MATERIALS/METHODS: We conducted a systematic review of MEDLINE, EMBASE, CINAHL and the Cochrane Library wi
thout date or language limitations designed to answer the question: Has administration of rFVIIa, PCC or aPCC been demo
nstrated to be effective in reversing PSAs?"
   },
   {
    "n": 7,
    "text": "The quality of the included studies was assessed based on standard methodologies."
   },
   {
    "n": 8,
    "text": "Relevant information was synthesised and reported."
   },
   {
    "n": 9,
    "text": "RESULTS: After an initial literature search, 197 abstracts were identified, of which 14 articles were revi
ewed in their entirety."
   },
   {
    "n": 10,
    "text": "Ultimately, five studies were identified that met inclusion and exclusion criteria."
   },
   {
    "n": 11,
    "text": "Although the literature is limited, the best available data support the use of rFVIIa for serious bleeding
 in patients anticoagulated with PSAs."
   },
   {
    "n": 12,
    "text": "CONCLUSIONS: Limited data support the use of rFVIIa as a reversal agent for serious bleeding in patients w
ho are anticoagulated with PSAs."
   },
   {
    "n": 13,
    "text": "The optimal dose, role for concomitant use of platelets or antifibrinolytic agents and exact indications f
or reversal remain to be determined."
   },
   {
    "n": 14,
    "text": "Such investigations are urgently needed as use of PSAs increases."
